      "value": "This can be marked as complete, since VRChat updated to yt-dlp 2026.03.03 today.\n\n```\n\nPS C:\\Users\\linda.LINDALAP\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\\Tools> .\\yt-dlp.exe --version\n\n2026.03.03\n\n```\n\nHowever, there are outstanding issues with yt-dlp 2026.03.03, so I've made another feature request: [Update to yt-dlp 2026.03.13 / yt-dlp-ejs 0.7.0 to improve YouTube playback compatibility](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/update-to-yt-dlp-20260313-yt-dlp-ejs-070-to-improve-youtube-playback-compatibili)",
